      "unimplemented_check": "silent_skip",
      "source_check_preserved": "check records source requirements; audit defines executable subset, not all source assertions",
      "override_semantics": "audit.when adds conditions to rule.when; audit.roles replaces executable targets, including document-level missing-structure checks; audit.tests overrides check.tests for execution only, null uses original properties/assertions; audit.requires lists shared dependencies only. Other provider failures make only their own facts unknown, not all subchecks.",
      "advisory": "comment_only_never_mutate",
      "partial_result": "各子项分别判定；一项unknown不掩盖其他明确失败。结构缺失只出一条结构提示，不虚构格式问题。"
